### Get All Audit Logs (Basic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Audit Logs with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?limit=1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Audit Logs (No Limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?limit=*
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs Filtered by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?user_id=3
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs Filtered by Action
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?action=user_created
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs Filtered by Model Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?model_type=App\Models\User
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs Filtered by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?date_from=2025-01-01&date_to=2025-12-31
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test OR Logic: User ID OR Action (should return logs matching either condition)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?user_id=1&action=role_created
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test OR Logic: Multiple Actions (should return logs matching any action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?action=user_created&action=user_updated
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test OR Logic: User OR Model Type (should return logs matching either condition)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?user_id=3&model_type=App\Models\Role
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test OR Logic: Date OR Action (should return logs matching either condition)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?date_from=2025-01-01&action=permissions_viewed
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs with Multiple Filters (OR Logic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?user_id=1&action=user_updated&limit=5
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Specific Audit Log Details (Replace {id} with actual audit log ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Specific Audit Log Details (Replace {id} with actual audit log ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs/2
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Unauthorized Access (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Unauthorized Access to Specific Log (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Invalid Audit Log ID (404 Error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs/99999
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test with Invalid Date Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?date_from=invalid-date
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test with Large Limit Value
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?limit=100
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs for Role Actions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?action=role_created
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Audit Logs for Permission Actions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?action=permissions_viewed
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
